@startuml
title UML state machine diagram - Video Suggestion System

[*] --> RequestReceived

state "Request Received" as RequestReceived
state "Identify User" as IdentifyUser
state "Gather Videos" as GatherVideos
state "Add Details" as AddDetails
state "Send Suggestions" as SendSuggestions

RequestReceived --> IdentifyUser : Receive request / Start process

IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos : User identified / Proceed to gather videos

GatherVideos --> AddDetails : Videos gathered / Prepare for display

AddDetails --> SendSuggestions : Details added (thumbnails, view counts) / Ready to send

SendSuggestions --> [*] : Suggestions sent / Process complete
@enduml
